## 7️⃣ FreeLang - 함수형 철학

### Hello, World!

```freelang
fn main(): Unit =
  println("Hello, World!")
```

**특징**: 2줄 (함수형)

### Fibonacci 구현

```freelang
// 기본 재귀
fn fib_recursive(n: i64) -> i64 =
  if n <= 1 then n else fib_recursive(n - 1) + fib_recursive(n - 2)

// 최적화: 반복
fn fib_iterative(n: i64) -> i64 =
  let loop = fn(acc: i64, b: i64, remaining: i64) -> i64 =
    if remaining == 0 then acc else loop(b, acc + b, remaining - 1)
  in loop(0, 1, n)

// 최적화: 패턴 매칭
fn fib_match(n: i64) -> i64 =
  match n with
  | 0 => 0
  | 1 => 1
  | _ => fib_match(n - 1) + fib_match(n - 2)

// 권장: 꼬리 재귀 최적화
fn fib_tail(n: i64, acc: i64, b: i64) -> i64 =
  if n == 0 then acc else fib_tail(n - 1, b, acc + b)

fn main(): Unit =
  println(fib_iterative(10))  // 55
```

### 성능 비교

```
재귀:      ~1ms
꼬리재귀:  <0.1ms (최적화)
반복:      <0.01ms
C 생성:    <0.001ms
```

### C로 변환 및 컴파일

```bash
# FreeLang → C 변환
freelang-to-c fib.fl -o fib.c

# GCC 컴파일
gcc -O2 fib.c -o fib

# 실행
./fib  # 결과: 55 (네이티브 속도)
```

### 최적화 팁

```freelang
// ❌ 피할 것: 순진한 재귀
fn fibonacci_bad(n: i64) -> Array[i64] =
  Array.map(fn(i) => fib_recursive(i), Array.range(0, n))

// ✅ 권장: 꼬리 재귀
fn fib_tail_optimized(n: i64) -> i64 =
  let rec loop(remaining: i64, a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 =
    if remaining == 0 then a
    else loop(remaining - 1, b, a + b)
  in loop(n, 0, 1)

// 함수형: 폴드 사용
fn fib_fold(n: i64) -> i64 =
  Array.fold(
    fn((a, b), _) => (b, a + b),
    (0, 1),
    Array.range(0, n)
  ) |> fn((a, _) => a)
```

